# UI Theme & Design System

Modern, high-contrast, card-based UI inspired by fitness-tracking apps. Clean, breathable, accessible — important for older admins and drivers using the app on the go.

## Color Palette

```dart
// Backgrounds
background:       #F5F5F5   // off-white app scaffold
surface:          #FFFFFF   // white cards
cardDark:         #1A1A1A   // hero/feature cards

// Text
textPrimary:      #000000
textSecondary:    #6B7280
textOnDark:       #FFFFFF

// Pastel accents (data cards, charts, categories)
lavender:         #E8DFF5   // earnings, stats
mint:             #D3EDE2   // fuel, active/online
peach:            #F9E8D9   // maintenance, warnings
skyBlue:          #D6EAF8   // other expenses, info

// Functional
accent:           #2DD4BF   // mint-cyan highlights, success
error:            #EF4444
```

Support both **light** (primary) and **dark** modes. Dark mode: charcoal scaffold, dark cards with subtle pink/lavender gradient glow at top.

## Typography

- Font: **Inter** (or SF Pro / system sans-serif)
- Page titles: `FontWeight.w800`, 28–32sp, left-aligned
- Metric numbers: `FontWeight.w900`, 36–48sp (e.g. "R1,850", "24")
- Labels: 12–13sp, gray, sometimes uppercase in pill badges
- Body: 15–16sp, generous line height (1.5)

## Shape & Spacing

- **Border radius**: 24–32px on cards, buttons, inputs — everything feels soft and modern
- **Padding**: 20–24px inside cards; 16px screen horizontal padding
- **Shadows**: minimal — rely on color contrast, not heavy elevation
- **Icons**: thin-stroke outline icons; circular frames for avatar/back/actions

## Core Components

### Pill Segmented Control (tabs/filters)
- Active: solid black bg, white text
- Inactive: white/transparent bg, thin gray border, black text
- Use for: Connection/Statistics/Shop → **Today | Week | Month** or **Drivers | Fleet | Reports**

### Hero Card (dark feature card)
- Large `cardDark` container, radius 32
- Left: bold label + oversized metric; right: inset image or icon on pastel gradient
- Carousel dots at bottom for swappable summaries
- Taxi app: "Today's Fleet — R42,850 earnings" or driver "Net R300"

### Pastel Data Cards
- Soft tinted backgrounds (lavender/mint/peach) with rounded corners
- Thin vertical bar charts, segmented progress bars, "View All >" link top-right
- Map colors: lavender = earnings, mint = fuel, peach = maintenance, skyBlue = other

### Timeline (driver history)
- Vertical line left with circular nodes
- Each day = pastel card: date, earnings, fuel, expenses, net

### Floating Bottom Nav
- Dark pill-shaped bar, rounded ends, 4–5 outline icons
- Driver: Home, Log, Add, History, Profile
- Admin: Dashboard, Drivers, Fleet, Reports, Settings

### Primary CTA
- Wide pill button, black bg, white text + chevron (`Save >>`, `Check In >>`)
- Reject/secondary: white pill, black border

## Screen Mapping

| Screen | Pattern |
|--------|---------|
| Driver dashboard | Hero card (today's net) + quick-action pills + recent timeline |
| Admin dashboard | Dark stat cards + pastel breakdown cards + pending approvals list |
| Daily log | Segmented steps, large currency input, pill type selector |
| Driver approval | White card, doc previews, Approve (black) / Reject (outlined) |
| Vehicle detail | Large mint card with vehicle image + circular shift progress |

